  "description": "The 37 Volt Unisex SKUTE Jet Fuel Folding Electric Scooter from Hyper is perfect for cruising around your neighborhood or downtown. Enjoy the benefits of using a scooter with assistance from the electronic motor and brake! The SKUTE E-Scooter has a portable folding design for easy storage at home or even in a car with a cool jet fuel paint job. Includes an LED display with speed indicator. The speed lever offers 3 speeds of 6 mph, 9 mph, and a maximum of 16 mph. Complete with LED headlights and rear lights, you can even go riding around your neighborhood at night! This scooter has a maximum distance per charge of 14 miles and a max weight of 264 lbs. The 8.5-inch solid tires in the front and rear and the handle rear disc brake complete this fun e-scooter. UL certified. Hyper Bicycles has established an ongoing commitment to supporting cycling through sponsorships of individuals and teams, and it has maintained its position as a leader in the industry, producing the highest quality parts that perform as well as they look.",
